cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "DriftWatch: malware-detector lifetime under label delay, a fixed analyst budget and conformal drift monitoring"
abstract: >-
  Pre-release research software. A time-aware protocol (TESSERACT constraints
  C1-C3, AUT and A-AUT) applied to pre-extracted LAMDA (Android) and BODMAS
  (Windows PE) feature files to study how label delay, a fixed analyst budget
  and drift monitoring change a malware detector's useful lifetime.
authors:
